  "limits": "Isolated Docker, network none, no lifespan. UI-only output. Lazy runtime getter stubbed to None to prevent hardware initialization. Message preview substitutes only runtime service/client; never executes hardware/provider writes. Hardware model deliberately null. Discovery IDs, generated IDs, revisions and timestamps aliased; test passwords redacted. No deployment compatibility claim.",
